    "name": "No Rest for the Weary",
    "steam_appid": 3529140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/54793958e1af609ad9d31fe8a8c02621.avif?t=1748643011\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/369493a8e49b4c6288dcd9c67b4f244d.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/369493a8e49b4c6288dcd9c67b4f244d.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/369493a8e49b4c6288dcd9c67b4f244d.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Rest for the Weary features two worlds, the real world and the mysterious Dream World. Although quite different on the surface, both worlds affect each other and present their own challenges to the main character, Joe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joe needs to balance the stress of college life, dealing with his unresolved past, and figuring out more about the Dream World and its meaning. By making social connections in the real world and solving dungeons in the Dream World, Joe moves closer to understanding these two worlds and himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/573097241b47e7158a9000f47ee68df0.avif?t=1748643011\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore your school</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/7d2a6f9c5c81340fd4d84791c3d97a6a.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/7d2a6f9c5c81340fd4d84791c3d97a6a.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/7d2a6f9c5c81340fd4d84791c3d97a6a.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to class, talk to other students, and see what\u2019s different about each day of the week. Make sure to pay attention to the people hanging around campus, they might become significant later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop Relationships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/f145e69194b05d9360a9e5c66bf49507.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/f145e69194b05d9360a9e5c66bf49507.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/f145e69194b05d9360a9e5c66bf49507.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time after class hanging out with other characters and learning more about them. As you increase your bond with other characters, you unlock new abilities to use in the Dream World.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/5f7b6843e5049e735dcfb59d0cc4ad43.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/5f7b6843e5049e735dcfb59d0cc4ad43.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/5f7b6843e5049e735dcfb59d0cc4ad43.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Enemies found in the Dream World using your combat skills and unlocked abilities from your bonds in the real world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/a9243dad2e46fbb21ab3625bef545fd7.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/a9243dad2e46fbb21ab3625bef545fd7.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/a9243dad2e46fbb21ab3625bef545fd7.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the residents of the Dream World by solving dungeons and uncovering their secrets. Figure out the significance of this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/bc041f588b60f98f65ae26ae18946623.avif?t=1748643011\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/54793958e1af609ad9d31fe8a8c02621.avif?t=1748643011\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/369493a8e49b4c6288dcd9c67b4f244d.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/369493a8e49b4c6288dcd9c67b4f244d.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/369493a8e49b4c6288dcd9c67b4f244d.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Rest for the Weary features two worlds, the real world and the mysterious Dream World. Although quite different on the surface, both worlds affect each other and present their own challenges to the main character, Joe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joe needs to balance the stress of college life, dealing with his unresolved past, and figuring out more about the Dream World and its meaning. By making social connections in the real world and solving dungeons in the Dream World, Joe moves closer to understanding these two worlds and himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/573097241b47e7158a9000f47ee68df0.avif?t=1748643011\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore your school</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster