1\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/5f7b6843e5049e735dcfb59d0cc4ad43.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/5f7b6843e5049e735dcfb59d0cc4ad43.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Enemies found in the Dream World using your combat skills and unlocked abilities from your bonds in the real world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/a9243dad2e46fbb21ab3625bef545fd7.poster.avif?t=1748643011\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/a9243dad2e46fbb21ab3625bef545fd7.webm?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/a9243dad2e46fbb21ab3625bef545fd7.mp4?t=1748643011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the residents of the Dream World by solving dungeons and uncovering their secrets. Figure out the significance of this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529140/extras/bc041f588b60f98f65ae26ae18946623.avif?t=1748643011\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>",
